@Aurora_HostAddress = http://localhost:5287

### 1) Login do administrador (seed de Development: admin@aurora.com / Admin@2026)
# @name login
POST {{Aurora_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@aurora.com",
  "password": "Admin@2026"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 2) Cadastro publico de usuario (perfil Clinic)
POST {{Aurora_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Recepcao Vida Animal",
  "email": "recepcao@vidaanimal.com.br",
  "password": "Senha@2026"
}

### 3) Dados do usuario logado
GET {{Aurora_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4) Sem token -> 401
GET {{Aurora_HostAddress}}/api/clinics

### 5) Clinicas (autenticado)
GET {{Aurora_HostAddress}}/api/clinics
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6) Planos (escrita exige perfil Admin)
POST {{Aurora_HostAddress}}/api/plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tier": 1,
  "name": "Aurora Premium Anual",
  "price": 599.00,
  "stripePriceId": "price_aurora_premium_anual"
}

### 7) Assinaturas
GET {{Aurora_HostAddress}}/api/subscriptions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8) Health check (publico)
GET {{Aurora_HostAddress}}/health
